WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 2, Scene 01h: Esthar city tour
Duration: ~31 seconds
Source: FF8 FMV — entering Esthar, city flyover, transport tube

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Through a futuristic arch with purple lights, the vast teal cityscape of Esthar stretches to the horizon. A radiant palace crowns the center.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Aerial view plunging into Esthar's dense skyline. Cylindrical towers, hexagonal platforms, pink energy beams cross between buildings.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
A green transparent transport capsule races along elevated rails through the city, motion-blurred.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
A hexagonal platform enters a blue-lit transit tunnel, mechanical struts reaching forward.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Inside the tunnel, blue light streaks past as the transport accelerates into darkness.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.400
Black. The transit sequence ends.
